# VS Code REST Client (humao.rest-client): click "Send Request" above each request, top to bottom.
# alice.tran is the seeded shopper from docker/keycloak/polaris-realm.json; NG-EARBUD-01 comes from V2__seed_data.sql.
@gateway = http://localhost:8082
@tokenUrl = https://id.polaris.local/realms/polaris/protocol/openid-connect/token
@clientId = polaris-app
@username = alice.tran
@password = testpass
@sku = NG-EARBUD-01

### 1. Password grant (request 2 reads the token from this response)
# @name login
POST {{tokenUrl}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id={{clientId}}&username={{username}}&password={{password}}

### 2. Search a seeded product through the Gravitee gateway: expect 200, X-Gravitee-Transaction-Id, the SKU in content[]
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/products?query={{sku}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 3. Without a token: polaris answers 401 (keyless plan)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/products?query={{sku}}
